00:00:23.520 --> 00:00:28.440
store up charge in electricity, and you make really small and 

00:00:28.840 --> 00:00:32.840
effective capacitors from Tantalum. So, Tantalum has gone from being

00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:35.880
an element that is not wildly exciting to something 

00:00:36.440 --> 00:00:39.560
that you find in every mobile phone.  -So this is a sample of

